  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You make two quick strikes with a melee weapon as a single attack.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When using a melee weapon with which you are proficient, you may make two strikes as a single attack against a single target. You take a -2 penalty on your attack roll, but deal +1 die of damage with a successful attack.</p><p><b>Special:</b> The effects of this feat do not stack with the extra damage provided by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mighty_Swing\" title=\"Mighty Swing\">Mighty Swing</a> Feat. If you do not have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> score of 13 or higher, increase the penalty to attacks to -5 when using this Feat with non-Light Weapons.</p>",
